MODULE: GatedPassShips
TARGET: BreakerBlocks
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a gated remediation pass still ships the localised rows
PERTURBS: RemediationGated

--- FIND
    /\ optOut \/ Blocking \/ consumed >= Budget
    /\ phase' = "idle" /\ loc' = {}
    /\ UNCHANGED dataVars
--- REPLACE
    /\ optOut \/ Blocking \/ consumed >= Budget
    /\ phase' = "idle" /\ loc' = {}
    /\ inflight' = inflight \cup {RepairMsg(k, aStore[k].ts, FALSE) : k \in FallbackRows}
    /\ UNCHANGED <<aStore, bStore, applied, hwm, wal, journal, walFloor, clock>>
--- END
